==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|skilja}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*skiljaną}}, from {{inh|is|ine-pro|*(s)kelH-}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈscɪlja/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɪlja|s=2}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|skildi|skilið}}

# to [[separate]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{syn|is|aðskilja}}
# to [[understand]] {{+obj|is|acc}}
#: {{ux|is|[[ég skil ekki|Ég '''skil''' ekki]].|[[I don't understand|I don't '''understand''']].}}
#: {{ux|is|Fyrirgefðu, en ég '''skil''' ekki frönsku.|I'm sorry but I don't '''understand''' French.}}
